        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/14/apple-promotes-creator-studio-with-three-commissioned-pieces/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/01/creator-studio.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>Apple has commissioned a few short creative pieces that show how <a href=\"https://apple.co/418nk3A\">Creator Studio</a> can be used across different kinds of creative work, including cooking videos, poetry, and music creation. You can watch them below.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-creator-studio\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052263\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/14/apple-promotes-creator-studio-with-three-commissioned-pieces/#more-1052263\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
