        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/17/spotify-confirms-disco-ball-app-icon-is-temporary-and-regular-logo-will-return/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/spotify-disco-ball.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>Spotify recently changed the app icon for its mobile app, and not everyone appreciates the celebratory disco ball logo.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apps,spotify\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052499\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/17/spotify-confirms-disco-ball-app-icon-is-temporary-and-regular-logo-will-return/#more-1052499\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
