        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/apple-will-soon-start-using-ai-generated-presenters-on-its-sales-coach-app/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/02/apple-sales-coach.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>As spotted by Aaron Perris, Apple will soon start using AI-generated presenters in its Apple Sales Coach app. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051946\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/apple-will-soon-start-using-ai-generated-presenters-on-its-sales-coach-app/#more-1051946\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
