        "title": "iOS 27’s upgraded Camera app will be ‘fully customizable,’ per report",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/ios-27s-upgraded-camera-app-will-be-fully-customizable-per-report/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/08/camera-app-ios-26-icon.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>iOS 27 has big changes coming for Apple’s Camera app, with a <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-05-12/ios-27-apple-plans-customizable-iphone-camera-app-siri-overhaul?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=author_alert&amp;utm_term=260512&amp;utm_campaign=author_19842959\">new report</a> saying it will be “fully customizable.” Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"camera,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051930\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/ios-27s-upgraded-camera-app-will-be-fully-customizable-per-report/#more-1051930\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
        "source": "9to5Mac"
