        "title": "iRacing arrives on Vision Pro with ‘immersion and fidelity never before seen in sim racing’",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/iracing-on-vision-pro-bringing-immersion-and-fidelity-never-before-seen-in-sim-racing/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/03/iracing.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>iRacing on Apple Vision Pro brings a “level of immersion and fidelity never before seen in sim racing,” says iRacing president Tony Gardner. The new app landed on the App Store this week after first being announced in March.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-vision-pro,iracing,visionos,visionos-26-4\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1044512\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/iracing-on-vision-pro-bringing-immersion-and-fidelity-never-before-seen-in-sim-racing/#more-1044512\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
