        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/meta-ai.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>Last month, Meta relaunched its AI efforts with Muse Spark, replacing its Llama models. As of today, Muse Spark is powering new experiences inside the Meta AI app.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,apps,meta\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051910\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/meta-ai-app-enhanced-with-new-features-using-muse-spark-heres-whats-new/#more-1051910\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
