        "title": "Severance season 3 is coming ‘much sooner’ than last season did, per star",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/severance-season-3-is-coming-much-sooner-than-last-season-did-per-star/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/07/severance-s2-finale.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>Apple TV’s hit sci-fi show Severance had a <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2024/12/04/why-severance-season-2-took-three-years-whats-coming-apple-tv/\">three-year gap</a> between seasons 1 and 2, but star Adam Scott now says season 3 will arrive “much sooner” than that. Here’s what he said, and what it means for release timing.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv,severance\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1051904\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/12/severance-season-3-is-coming-much-sooner-than-last-season-did-per-star/#more-1051904\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
