        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/govee-tv-backlight.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p>Govee is launching its new TV Backlight 3 product, bringing cinema-grade reactive lighting with Matter support to your home theater.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-home,govee,matter\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052310\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/18/govee-tv-backlight-3-brings-cinema-grade-reactive-lighting-with-matter-support/#more-1052310\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
