        "title": "WhatsApp finally starts rolling out Liquid Glass more broadly on iOS",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/15/whatsapp-finally-starts-rolling-out-liquid-glass-more-broadly-on-ios/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/whatsapp-liquid-glass.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>After months of very limited testing, WhatsApp is finally bringing the first stage of its Liquid Glass redesign to more users. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"liquid-glass,whatsapp\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052442\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/15/whatsapp-finally-starts-rolling-out-liquid-glass-more-broadly-on-ios/#more-1052442\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
