        "title": "OpenAI preparing ‘legal action’ against Apple over Siri partnership: report",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/14/openai-preparing-legal-action-against-apple-over-siri-partnership-report/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/apple-openai.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>Apple and OpenAI <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2024/06/10/apple-chatgpt-ios-18/\">inked a deal</a> to integrate ChatGPT with Siri as part of iOS 18 in 2024. According to a new report today, however, OpenAI is displeased with how the partnership has played out and is considering taking legal action against Apple.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,openai\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1052224\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/14/openai-preparing-legal-action-against-apple-over-siri-partnership-report/#more-1052224\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
